  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact Small and Medium Enterprises Development, Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will accomplish the following outputs: 1.Select 10 -15 women -led Impact Small and Medium Enterprises (iSMEs) for capacity support 2.Conduct group training and follow up with tailored training and mentor ship to make iSMEs investment ready 3.Conduct a gender and protection analysis assessment to ascertain gender gaps in women -led iSME financing and general Business Development Services (BDS) support in the country 4. Undertake an analysis and review of Small and Medium Enterprise (SME) policies in the country to identify gender gaps 5.Hold round table discussions with duty bearers to lobby for an enabling policy environment for women SMEs 6. Hold networking sessions to bring together women -led iSMEs, industry actors and government officials for peer learning, knowledge sharing and back stopping to hold duty bearers accountable.</narrative>
  </description>
